<p>Hello World!</p>

<p>This is me from the 27th of September, 2026. A rainy day in İzmir, my hometown. I am home alone, sitting at my desk and trying to figure out life.</p>

<p>All this time, I waited to feel ready. But then I realized ready will never find me. So, I am going to start anyway.</p>

<p>I have a lot to say. Tons of ideas have been going back and forth in my mind for years now. I have to admit, I still doubt myself. What if things don’t turn out the way I want them to be?</p>

<p>I cannot see the end of the tunnel — in fact, I don't even know if I've actually started to dig my way at all!</p>

<p>Yet all I have is a belief that tells me I can do it.</p>

<p>No, I am going to do it.</p>

<p>No!</p>

<p>I will make it happen no matter what!</p>

<p>And figure out the rest on the road.</p>

<p>Here, in this blog, I plan to pour out whatever storm is happening in my head that day. I will share my struggles and how I chose to sort them out.</p>
<p>I will be real.</p>

<p>As I look back to today from someday in the future, I want to be able to see the path that I created for myself, hopefully feeling proud.</p>

<p>I want to be seen so that I can break out of my shell and set myself free — I will step out even if I feel scared.</p>

<p>And here I am, a beginner on my own road, not afraid of the world judging my faults and mistakes, because I know I will grow!</p>

